   "updated_at": "2026-10-28T06:32:29Z",
   "body": "This looks fixed on main now: yetone's e5dd8696 (#3682) joins every upgrade with a WaitGroup and waits for it in fakeInstall and its cleanup, which is what my 8b61a25d did, and 8b61a25d no longer applies anyway. `go test -race -count=5 ./internal/pii` on f25871cd passes with no race reported, so I'm dropping my patch. Fine to close from my side.\n",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
