   "body": "I'll take this one, unless you're already on it @erickguan. Same 6 warnings here on 42ec2700 with go1.26.8. In most of them the upgrade goroutine has already finished, it's just never joined, so nothing orders its reads before the cleanup's writes (polling `upgrading` can't help the path where upgrade returns early without touching it). Plan: a WaitGroup for upgrade() that fakeInstall waits on before it changes or puts back the vars, which also covers TestWarm's second fakeInstall.\n",
